NAEOS release signing key (Ed25519)
====================================

All GitHub Release assets are signed with the NAEOS release key and ship
with a matching `<artifact>.sig.json` bundle alongside the release.

Verify any downloaded asset with:

    naeos sign verify <artifact>.sig.json

The bundle embeds the public key, artifact hash, and signature, so no
separate key argument is required.

